,"text":"長子藻，位東陽太守，尚文帝第六女臨川長公主，諱英媛。公主性妒，而藻別愛左右人吳崇祖。景和中，主讒之於廢帝，藻下獄死，主與王氏離婚。宋世諸主莫不嚴妒，明帝每疾之。湖熟令袁慆妻以妒賜死，使近臣虞通之撰妒婦記。左光祿大夫江湛孫學當尚孝武帝女，上乃使人為學作表讓婚曰：","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0002","surface":"藻","start":2,"end":3,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0023","surface":"英媛","start":23,"end":25,"person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0032","surface":"藻","start":32,"end":33,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0038","surface":"吳崇祖","start":38,"end":41,"person_id":"10h_hln_g8o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0053","surface":"藻","start":53,"end":54,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0083","surface":"袁慆","start":83,"end":85,"person_id":"g6j_uqk_ggg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0085","surface":"妻","start":85,"end":86,"person_id":"b3n_qau_l8t","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0094","surface":"虞通之","start":94,"end":97,"person_id":"7pm_fo0_m0j","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0107","surface":"江湛","start":107,"end":109,"person_id":"o1i_tao_gu1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p001:m0110","surface":"學","start":110,"end":111,"person_id":"s2k_e90_mxi","kind":"person","status":"contextual_prov